0..64 Comment "// Two tasks forked side by side never order each other\'s plays."
65..67 Comment "//"
68..144 Comment "// Each task hands its notes back over its own end, and neither waits on the"
145..223 Comment "// other. Each channel\'s web is series-parallel, with no prime node, whichever"
224..255 Comment "// task the parent joins first."
256..258 Comment "//"
259..334 Comment "// The parent forks two tasks and joins them in the reverse of the order it"
335..395 Comment "// forked them. The trace states each channel\'s prime count."
396..398 Comment "//"
399..467 Comment "// - see: `forced.gandr` — a task whose reply waits on its request"
468..545 Comment "// - see: #3338 — the run\'s trace and the web a source states for a channel"
547..571 Comment "// The task\'s protocols."
